# Prerequisites

This repository requires OpenJDK 27, mainly due to the use of the

    MemorySegment.getString(long, Charset, long)

method for extracting fixed-length strings from native byte arrays.

# Portability

The enyo.linux system call trampoline has only been implemented for
x86-64.  Linux UAPI metadata currently covers aarch64, loongarch64,
powerpc64le, riscv64, s390x, x86-64.  See the
enyo.linux.buildtools.Architecture enum.

# Building

Run this command:

    java bootstrap/Bootstrap.java --once

Without the option, the process will not terminate, wait for source
code changes, and automatically rebuild and run the test suite.

